  from="$5.69"
  intro="The Banana Split is one of DQ’s oldest treats and still one of the best for sharing. Each scoop gets a different topping, so you get three desserts in one dish."
  spec={[
    ['Price', '$5.69'],
    ['Calories', '560'],
