  <h2>Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Share it. Three scoops is a lot for one person after a meal.</li>
    <li>Not a pineapple fan? Ask to swap it for another topping, such as more hot fudge. Some stores charge a little extra.</li>
    <li>Eat it soon. The banana and fruit toppings make it melt faster than a Blizzard.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>See every cone, sundae and classic treat on the <a href="/categories/classic-treats">classic treats menu</a>.</p>
